OL,3,ATrump repeats Iran ultimatum and says
OL,4,AAI should be rebranded 'super
OL,5,Aintelligence' in UN speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has warned
OL,8,FIran it should reach a deal with the US
OL,9,For face "annihilation"
OL,11,FHe made the threat while speaking to
OL,12,Fworld leaders at the UN General
OL,13,FAssembly - it was a familiar strategy
OL,14,Fof coercive diplomacy, writes our BBC
OL,15,FPersian correspondent in Washington,
OL,16,FKhashayar Joneidi
OL,18,FOn Ukraine, Trump again claimed an end
OL,19,Fto the war with Russia is near - while
OL,20,Fhe also said the US will rename AI as
OL,21,F"super intelligence"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
