OL,3,ATrump repeats Iran ultimatum and says
OL,4,AAI should be rebranded 'super
OL,5,Aintelligence' in UN speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 130 heads of state and
OL,8,Fgovernment attend the annual week-long
OL,9,Fevent to deliver a message from their
OL,10,Fnation to the world
OL,12,FOpening this year's session, UN
OL,13,FSecretary General Antonio Guterres said
OL,14,F"faultlines in our world are widening"
OL,16,FTrump will soon have his first
OL,17,Fface-to-face meeting with UK Prime
OL,18,FMinister Andy Burnham, who has said he
OL,19,Fhopes the pair can find "common ground"
